# Avalanche with X=2 destroys exactly two snow lands, one belonging to each player, leaving a nonsnow land (CR 701.8a).
# Two Lotuses pay the six-mana cost exactly; the target question refuses a nonsnow land and a wrong count.
[Bot1 Deck]
Avalanche
Black Lotus x2
Snow-Covered Forest
Island x16
[Bot2 Deck]
Snow-Covered Plains
Plains x19
[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Snow-Covered Forest.Play
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Snow-Covered Plains.Play
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Island.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus#1.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Red)
Bot1.Hand.Avalanche.Cast(X: 2)
! Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Island)
! Bot1.Target(Count: 1)
Bot1.Target(Bot1.Battlefield.Snow-Covered Forest; Bot2.Battlefield.Snow-Covered Plains)
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Avalanche; Snow-Covered Forest; Black Lotus; Black Lotus
Bot2.Graveyard = Snow-Covered Plains
Bot1.Battlefield.Island.Tapped = false
